Z||000009||Fierowrecker||05-01-2001||10:22 PM||||Hey Russ and everyone else!<BR>I am surprised no one mentions my favorite repair adhesive...<BR>What is the fenders and bumpers made from?<BR>PVC? ABS?<BR>What is plastic pipe made from?<BR>PVC? ABS?<BR>It is in your local plumbing store...<BR>And if your repair needs backing, cut up an old fender, or even some plastic pipe!<BR>I have repaired many cracks in my and friends Fieros, none have recracked...<BR>crash...||||reg||1
